<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Devine to develop A$120 mln estate.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Devine to develop A$120 mln estate.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Property developer Devine Ltd said on Monday it plans to build a A$120 million housing development in Collingwood Park in the western surburbs of Brisbane following the purchase of 977 allotments or 162 hectares of land.  </p>
<p>Devine marketing director Ken Woodley said in a statement that work would begin on the estate immediately and proceed over the next seven to 10 years.</p>
<p>At 3.00 p.m. (0500 GMT), Devine shares were steady at 51 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
